      "There is a time for editing, and it arrives when the child wants the piece to be read by someone else. \"Shall we tidy the spelling so Grandma can read it?\" gives the correction a purpose that comes from the child's own goal rather than the adult's standards. That is a completely different conversation from having the errors pointed out unbidden.",
