      "Reading in the car turns dead time into the ritual, and has the additional advantage that nobody has to make eye contact, which older children frequently prefer.",
      "A long book read over months works better than a short one at this age. A chapter a night of something substantial gives the evening a thread that runs through the week, and the shared knowledge of where you both are in it becomes its own reason to continue.",
